+puts "============"
+puts "Modeling Algorithms - Fillet ending on a cylinder split by a smooth edge"
+puts "(FreeCAD issue 32486)"
+puts "============"
+puts ""
+
+# The thread starts at the seam plane of the cylinder. Above the start the
+# outer cylinder is two faces on one surface, joined by a smooth edge that
+# runs up from the end of the filleted edge.
+restore [locate_data_file freecad32486_thread.brep] b
+explode b E
+
+# The concave edge between the start wall of the thread and its flank.
+blend result b 1 b_6
+
+checkshape result
+checkmaxtol result -ref 1.e-4
+checkprops result -v 8685.18 -s 3090.36
